<i>The cure for death itself?</i>

988
01:26:41,364 --> 01:26:44,117
<i>The answer is immortality.</i>

989
01:26:45,368 --> 01:26:47,578
Daniel!

990
01:26:49,831 --> 01:26:51,708
<i>By creating a legacy,</i>

991
01:26:52,458 --> 01:26:56,838
<i>by living a life worth remembering,
you become immortal.</i>

992
01:26:57,338 --> 01:27:00,633
<i>So now you find the tables are turned.</i>

993
01:27:00,717 --> 01:27:01,968
He asked for you.

994
01:27:02,051 --> 01:27:03,553
- What the fuck do you want?
- I told you.

995
01:27:03,636 --> 01:27:04,887
He wants us to survive this.

996
01:27:04,971 --> 01:27:06,556
I want to play a game.

997
01:27:06,848 --> 01:27:08,641
You have to play by the fucking rules!

998
01:27:08,641 --> 01:27:09,809
The rules are simple.

999
01:27:09,892 --> 01:27:11,686
All you have to do is sit here
and talk to me.

1000
01:27:11,686 --> 01:27:12,687
What?

1001
01:27:12,770 --> 01:27:15,148
If you can do that long enough,
you will find your son

1002
01:27:15,148 --> 01:27:16,357
in a safe and secure state.

1003
01:27:16,441 --> 01:27:17,567
What the fuck is that?

1004
01:27:17,650 --> 01:27:19,402
It's your son, Daniel.
You remember him, don't you?

1005
01:27:19,485 --> 01:27:20,486
My dad's a...

1006
01:27:20,570 --> 01:27:21,696
He's a real hardass.

1007
01:27:21,696 --> 01:27:22,989
<i>I call you unworthy</i>

1008
01:27:22,989 --> 01:27:25,032
<i>of the life that you've been given.</i>

1009
01:27:25,032 --> 01:27:27,160
<i>The knowledge
of your son's impending death</i>

1010
01:27:27,160 --> 01:27:29,370
<i>has caused you to forgive all his sins.</i>

1011
01:27:29,370 --> 01:27:32,331
Why is that we're only willing to do that
when a life is at stake?

1012
01:27:32,415 --> 01:27:33,541
Daniel!

1013
01:27:33,541 --> 01:27:34,584
I'm done listening to you.

1014
01:27:34,667 --> 01:27:35,668
Don't forget the rules.

1015
01:27:35,752 --> 01:27:36,753
Shut the fuck up!

1016
01:27:36,836 --> 01:27:37,879
He's playing a game.

1017
01:27:37,879 --> 01:27:38,880
I don't wanna talk to him.

1018
01:27:38,963 --> 01:27:40,006
You're not saying shit.

1019
01:27:40,089 --> 01:27:41,466
We both know the sort of person you are.

1020
01:27:41,716 --> 01:27:44,010
Not long to go now
until your son is pissing...

1021
01:27:45,178 --> 01:27:46,888
I'll take you to the house.

1022
01:27:46,971 --> 01:27:48,306
Daniel?

1023
01:27:49,932 --> 01:27:52,018
There's something I haven't told you, Eric.

1024
01:27:52,602 --> 01:27:56,355
<i>It is I who will carry on John's work
after he dies.</i>

1025
01:27:56,355 --> 01:27:58,024
Daniel!

1026
01:27:58,024 --> 01:28:01,068
So go ahead. Destroy it.

1027
01:28:01,152 --> 01:28:02,403
<i>And you...</i>

1028
01:28:02,487 --> 01:28:03,571
Daniel!

1029
01:28:03,571 --> 01:28:06,407
<i>...Are my first test subject.</i>

1030
01:28:06,866 --> 01:28:08,910
<i>Now you are locked away,</i>

1031
01:28:09,160 --> 01:28:11,704
<i>helpless and alone.</i>

1032
01:28:15,583 --> 01:28:18,169
- You fucking bitch.
- Game over.

1033
01:28:18,461 --> 01:28:20,505
<i>I'll</i> fucking kill you!

1034
01:28:21,130 --> 01:28:23,049
You fucking bitch!

1035
01:28:23,716 --> 01:28:25,927
You fucking bitch!

1036
01:28:27,678 --> 01:28:29,680
<i>I'll</i> fucking kill you!

1037
01:28:30,389 --> 01:28:31,599
No!

1038
01:28:36,896 --> 01:28:38,564
No!

